{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ☻！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、2月17日、斎藤ちはる、\n17歳になりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/17/6481571/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと華のセブンティーンです\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17歳って、\n大人と子供のちょうど狭間だと思ってて、\n子供から大人へと段々変わっていく1年なのかなーって考えてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこの1年で、\n見た目も、心も大人っぽい人になりたい(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今年の目標は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「キラキラした人間になる！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/17/6481571/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/17/6481571/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セブンティーンって、なんか\nキラキラしてて輝いてるイメージがあって☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから自分もそんなキラキラしてて\n他のみんなまでも楽しませられるような\n素敵な人間になりたいな♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔のあたし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/17/6481571/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目が大きすぎて\nおじいちゃんからずっと、\n「ひとみちゃん」と呼ばれてた時代。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜひとみちゃん。笑(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/17/6481571/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫ちゃんになりたかった時代。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分ぱぱにいたずらされたのかな(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/17/6481571/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして現在。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しは大人っぽくなったかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔が全盛期なんて言わせませんよ！(｡-_-｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで、成長してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと大人っぽくなって、\n心も成長して、\nたくさんの方に愛される人になります(* ˆωˆ *)断言"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばる！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも応援宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/17/6481571/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/17/6481571/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な1年に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´